From 263feee286b41ae74f9f27941777d457f9099881 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 06:03:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 62/75] perf(polynomials): AVX-512 IFMA tiles in
 add_scaled_batch

Each 256-element tile of dst is held in 52-bit limbs while every source is applied (one conversion per
dst element per tile), all-zero source blocks are skipped, partial blocks use masked loads, unit
scalars skip the multiplication. Runtime-dispatched with the scalar tile loop as fallback; outputs are
the same field values.
